            { q: 'Where is Golghar Patna?', a: 'Golghar Patna is in the Ashok Rajpath Road area of Bihar, west of Gandhi Maidan. The map address is Opp. Govt. Girls High School, Patna, Bihar 800001. The reference point is 25.620337, 85.139448; this is not a guarantee of parking or a specific entrance.' },
            { q: 'What are Golghar’s hours and weekly closure?', a: 'The Google Maps listing observed on 23 October 2026 showed 09:00–17:00 Tuesday to Sunday, closed on Monday. Bihar Tourism’s destination listing gives 09:00–18:00 and the Incredible India entry gives 09:30–18:00. These three public listings differ, so treat none as final. Check the site or official tourism information before you travel.' },
