            `Reviewed on ${REVIEWED_ON_TEXT.en}. History: Patna district administration. Opening hours and public rating: a dated Google Maps listing. Current tourism information: Bihar Tourism and Incredible India. The last two links are entry points to official information; they do not confirm today’s ticket rate or access to the upper part.`,
            `The Google Maps public rating and review count were observed from a third-party listing on ${REVIEWED_ON_TEXT.en}; they can change.`
          ],
          images: 'All images are original SVG drawings made for this guide. Earlier photographs were removed because their current identity and licence could not be confirmed.',
